menu "Remote Gateway ELRS"

    config ELRS_RX_GPIO
        int "UART1 RX GPIO (connect receiver TX here)"
        range 0 48
        default 16
        help
            Select a free input-capable GPIO exposed on your development board.
            GPIO16 is the initial wiring choice for the ESP32-S3 dev kit.

    config ELRS_SIGNAL_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "RC channel freshness timeout (ms)"
        range 50 1000
        default 200
        help
            Only CRC-checked, range-checked RC channel frames refresh this timer.

endmenu
